  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T11:23:40.798056Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T11:30:23.813605Z",
  "totalBlocks": 16,
  "translatedBlocks": 16,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ec4b808aeba6c8e",
      "translationZh": "我是一名在伦敦工作的全科医生，开发了 OpenConsult，这是一个研究原型，能聆听问诊过程，并在过程中建议要问的问题和可能的诊断。问诊结束时，OpenConsult 会撰写一份 SOAP 病历，并生成一份区分说话人的转录文本。它完全在本地运行；医生始终掌握主导权，每个病例都通过角色扮演或预先编写的脚本来模拟。不涉及真实患者。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90f7a5c9ebc733ec",
      "translationZh": "在自动模式下，它会自行向患者提问，因此患者需要等待模型思考。我希望在患者说完后的 3 秒内，系统就能说出下一个问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e8bf3a413c4a25b",
      "translationZh": "机器配置：一张 RTX 4090（24 GB）、96 GB RAM、i9-13900K。语音模型和一个嵌入模型与语言模型共用这张显卡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec20cf2bcc7a9755",
      "translationZh": "MedGemma 27B（Q4_K_M）每轮耗时 18 秒。Gemma 4 26B-A4B QAT 耗时 5 秒，临床评分相同或略好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3aaeb6f9c77ce5de",
      "translationZh": "Ollama 和 llama.cpp 的速度相同。vLLM 更快，耗时 3.5 秒，但它占用了显卡显存的 94%，而前两者为 70%，语音模型也需要显存空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c24a91391e22742",
      "translationZh": "将一轮中的两次调用一起发送后，Ollama 的耗时缩短至 3.8 秒，vLLM 的耗时缩短至 2.8 秒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c12617b4598eee24",
      "translationZh": "在整个问诊过程中保留同一个上下文并没有帮助。每次调用都使用全新的上下文，效果至少同样好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a13382985f90a5b7",
      "translationZh": "我还测试了 Qwen3.6-35B-A3B、Nemotron 3.5 Lightning 和 gpt-oss-20b。Gemma 4 仍然领先。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b7b949f0d107f78",
      "translationZh": "一轮处理包含两次依次进行的调用：一次警报检查（输入约 1,000 个 token，输出 160 个），以及一次评估（输入约 800 个 token，输出 570 个）。每次调用读取提示词大约需要 0.1 秒。这 5 秒几乎全都用在模型生成回答上，速度约为每秒 170 个 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0a892444c095601",
      "translationZh": "速度并不是唯一的考验。模型不能从列表中漏掉任何严重疾病的诊断，而且每次都必须返回格式规范的 JSON。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce00846eba1a3749",
      "translationZh": "还有什么能缩短耗时？调整设置、推测解码，还是缩短回答？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6291a9e5a0cee7d",
      "translationZh": "我还应该对哪些引擎进行基准测试？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18ee21cdf98c75b8",
      "translationZh": "我应该尝试用哪些模型替代 Gemma 4 26B QAT？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85b37760bc27b783",
      "translationZh": "有 96 GB 的 RAM，能否将某些模型放到 CPU 和系统 RAM 上运行，比如嵌入模型，甚至主模型，同时仍能足够快地给出回答？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c11fa7e446025db",
      "translationZh": "项目位于 OpenConsult（AGPL-3.0）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce25226886765648",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/looneycheetah 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
